/*
  DetailedStatistics.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0101 · DetailedStatistics (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `DetailedStatistics`
  resolves (table "DetailedStatistics") lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English value.
  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they
  are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/charging/components/charging-list/DetailedStatistics.tsx). The remainder back the native
  state envelope (freshness chip, connectivity banner, loading / error chrome, refresh) and the
  VoiceOver empty message.
*/

